1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,760
Its other reactions, one line each.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,000
Reduction gives dichloromethane.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,703
Heating with silver powder strips all the chlorine and joins two carbons: ethyne.

4
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:16,054
Nitric acid gives chloropicrin, a tear gas and soil fumigant.

5
00:00:16,054 --> 00:00:20,937
Propanone with dilute alkali gives chloretone, a sedative.

6
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:24,127
Boiling alkali gives sodium methanoate.

7
00:00:24,127 --> 00:00:33,658
And with a primary amine and alcoholic potash, it gives an isocyanide with an appalling smell: the carbylamine test for primary amines.

